cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Huginn in your research or project, please cite it as below."
title: "Huginn"
abstract: >-
  Huginn is an LLM-driven agent system for general scientific research. It
  automates DFT calculations, molecular dynamics, CFD/FEA simulation, symbolic
  regression, causal analysis (TDA/SINDy), and multi-agent research collaboration,
  with Lean 4 formal verification of the underlying mathematics. Its literature
  depth layers factor reported values by real physical degrees of freedom
  (functional / temperature / method) rather than conflating discrepancies, and
  attach object-level provenance to every extracted claim.
type: software
keywords:
  - scientific-agent
  - materials-science
  - dft
  - molecular-dynamics
  - formal-verification
  - lean4
  - causal-analysis
  - llm
